    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's nighttime, you're driving through a dark road and heading to the event of the year... To the Halloween party that your friends have prepared in a macabre farmhouse far from the city, which has a strange legend behind it tainted by sadness and despair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While you are enjoying the party, someone is watching you from afar...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A silent gas station in the middle of the woods, a ramshackle farm, sinister cornfields, dark barns... A horror story in the classic style of the 90's Slasher movies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/1642f86e0623698d637db41b70bce5f8.poster.avif?t=1752770171\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/1642f86e0623698d637db41b70bce5f8.webm?t=1752770171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/1642f86e0623698d637db41b70bce5f8.mp4?t=1752770171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and gloomy levels with a unique detail and care for details of @TonyDevGame,  (I love detailing the games friends!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.poster.avif?t=1752770171\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.webm?t=1752770171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.mp4?t=1752770171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bored of walking simulators? No problem, here you will have to run for your life, and you will also be able to face your enemies!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.poster.avif?t=1752770171\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.webm?t=1752770171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.mp4?t=1752770171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a great time at the party with your buddies! Have a beer, dance a little, talk to your friends, throw a few firecrackers.... Enjoy before it's too late!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/cf6fe1ef9662140842afd62f1636e98d.poster.avif?t=1752770171\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/cf6fe1ef9662140842afd62f1636e98d.webm?t=1752770171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/cf6fe1ef9662140842afd62f1636e98d.mp4?t=1752770171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The game has an autosave system and some gore scenes.</strong></i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's nighttime, you're driving through a dark road and heading to the event of the year... To the Halloween party that your friends have prepared in a macabre farmhouse far from the city, which has a strange legend behind it tainted by sadness and despair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While you are enjoying the party, someone is watching you from afar...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A silent gas station in the middle of the woods, a ramshackle farm, sinister cornfields, dark barns... A horror story in the classic style of the 90's Slasher movies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/1642f86e0623698d637db41b70bce5f8.poster.avif?t=1752770171\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/1642f86e0623698d637db41b70bce5f8.webm?t=1752770171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/1642f86e0623698d637db41b70bce5f8.mp4?t=1752770171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and gloomy levels with a unique detail and care for details of @TonyDevGame,  (I love detailing the games friends!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.poster.avif?t=1752770171\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.webm?t=1752770171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.mp4?t=1752770171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bored of walking simulators? No problem, here you will have to run for your life, and you will also be able to face your enemies!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.poster.avif?t=1752770171\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.webm?t=1752770171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.mp4?t=1752770171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a great time at the party with your buddies! Have a beer, dance a little, talk to your friends, throw a few firecrackers.... Enjoy before it's too late!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/cf6fe1ef9662140842afd62f1636e98d.poster.avif?t=1752770171\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/cf6fe1ef9662140842afd62f1636e98d.webm?t=1752770171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/cf6fe1ef9662140842afd62f1636e98d.mp4?t=1752770171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The game has an autosave system and some gore scenes.</strong></i></p>",
